Z||000005||Cheever2||04-27-2001||10:24 AM||||My baby has a way of luring me back to her.  She constantly requires my touch.  But I don't mind.  She looks great even in the morning.  Don't get me wrong, we've had our rainy days when life was a little slippery, but we just took it slow and somehow always managed to get through.  Not like my first baby.  That one was my fault, I was moving too fast, and didn't yet know how to handle such a fine petite little thing.  She's coming back to me soon, however, and my latest love will have to leave.  Call me crazy, but I'm choosing the more adventurous one.  Did I mention she's black?<P>||||reg||6
