Z||000009||Spektyr||04-27-2001||08:23 PM||||Wow.<P>You know that old saying "Cat got your tongue?"  Well, it's true.  Today I performed a cat-ectomy on my girl.  I thought she was a screamer before...<P>Now she has a beautiful deep purr when she's just waiting for me to give it to her.  When I really stick it to her, hooo boy!  The guys with their ricer-girls all stare jealously at me now.  Ya know, the one's who's girls have a tailpipe the size of a Folgers coffee can...<P>Those ricer boys might like their front-driven women, but I just look at them and think, "You coulda had a girl that does it from the back."<P>Then I nail her and let her wiggle her ass at them.<P>------------------<BR>85 GT (to be modified...)<BR>--Um, no the paint isn't oxidized, that's the ultra-rare Whirlpool White textured finish... yeah.<BR>89 Lincoln Town Car (has Fiero Envy)<BR>--Hey!  Can I have an anti-sway bar too?||||reg||1
