Z||000011||Nashco||04-28-2001||12:06 AM||||My baby isn't much to brag about now...no sir.  She is way too loud, sloppy in all the places she should be tight, and never puts out as much as I want her to.  She also has a real bad habit of trying to get me into trouble.  To top it all off, my buddies like her; seems they have all had a good ride at least once.  I'm trying to convince her to go on a urethane diet, that would really help the sloppy problem.  I'm also looking into getting some counseling at the muffler shop to help our problems with her being so loud.  I don't have many plans to get her to put out in the immediate future, I'll wait till she's a little older for that.  All in all though, I still love her; she has a lot of character and hasn't let me down yet <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> *knock on wood*<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
Z||000012||Steve Normington||04-29-2001||01:18 AM||||My baby just got an operation to take her from an adequate 28 to a whopping 34E. I tightened up her front and rear end, gave her a new rack, and replaced the old rubber to give me better feel. Now if only I could get her to turn over...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>I don't car if my next Fiero is a 2M Hamster, I'm not swapping the engine.||||reg||10
Z||000013||BAM-BAM||04-29-2001||10:41 AM||||  It's amazing what new pair of shos can do. I have been on her about living in the 70's and that she needed to get with the times. Well, I finaly just went ahead and did it myself without asking; man what a difference. Of course with the new look comes problems. Seems that she is so impressed with herself that she has started flirting with other guys. Now I'm not the jealous type, but isn't that about how it goes. As soon as they find out what it is that guys like they get you to get it for them then they start lookin for the BBD (Bigger, Better, Deal) I also bought her a nice black BRA with her name on it. It was supposed to be a present for when I get her new coat (kinda sexy huh) Well, I'm not sure I'll give it to her right away. I also got her to commit to the 3.4L diet. I hope that all this new found beauty dosen't drive her away. I have had that happen with a previous love. Got her augmented, helped her through her recovery, even made plans of a long happy life together. Then, when she realized what she had and guys started paying more attention, well, here I am and she's not. Just be carefull how much you dress them up. Once they know they look better, you'll be in trouble.<P>Peace, B2 OUT! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||12
